* ADP7118 LDO: 3.3 V IN -> 1.8 V OUT @ 50 mA resistive load
* -----------------------------------------------------------
* Genuine ADI model is instantiated as a subcircuit (not redefined here).
* Pin order of ADI's model: VIN VOUT ADJ EN GND
.include ADP7118.lib

* ---------------- Source ----------------
VIN  IN 0 DC 3.3

* ---------------- Input decoupling ----------------
CIN  IN 0 1u

* ---------------- Enable (tied to input, active high) ----------------
REN  IN EN 100

* ---------------- Regulator ----------------
XU1  IN OUT ADJ EN 0 ADP7118

* ---------------- Output programming divider (VREF = 1.2 V) ----------------
* VOUT = 1.2 * (1 + R1/R2) = 1.2 * (1 + 10k/20k) = 1.8 V
R1   OUT ADJ 10k
R2   ADJ 0   20k

* ---------------- Output decoupling ----------------
COUT OUT 0 1u

* ---------------- Load: 1.8 V / 36 ohm = 50 mA ----------------
RLOAD OUT 0 36

* ---------------- Analysis ----------------
.tran 10u 5m 0 1u startup
.meas TRAN vout_dc AVG V(OUT) FROM=4m TO=5m
.meas TRAN iload   AVG I(RLOAD) FROM=4m TO=5m

.options plotwinsize=0
.end
